#ASSERT `the inspector may use the power` `ind-b a fully equipped inspector` `order measurements and tests kept`

§§ `s.32 (I32-1 .. I32-5)`

#ASSERT `s 32 — the inspector may use the powers` `ind-b a fully equipped inspector`
#ASSERT NOT `s 32 — the inspector may use the powers` (`ind-b inspector with powers` `ind-b all powers` `, on duty` TRUE `, badge visible` FALSE `, certificate signed by the Minister` TRUE `, certificate demanded` FALSE `, shown` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 32 — the inspector may use the powers` (`ind-b inspector with powers` `ind-b all powers` `, on duty` TRUE `, badge visible` TRUE `, certificate signed by the Minister` FALSE `, certificate demanded` FALSE `, shown` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 32 — the inspector may use the powers` (`ind-b inspector with powers` `ind-b all powers` `, on duty` FALSE `, badge visible` TRUE `, certificate signed by the Minister` TRUE `, certificate demanded` FALSE `, shown` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 32 — the inspector may use the powers` (`ind-b inspector with powers` `ind-b all powers` `, on duty` TRUE `, badge visible` TRUE `, certificate signed by the Minister` TRUE `, certificate demanded` TRUE `, shown` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 32 — the inspector may use the powers` (`ind-b inspector with powers` `ind-b all powers` `, on duty` TRUE `, badge visible` TRUE `, certificate signed by the Minister` TRUE `, certificate demanded` TRUE `, shown` TRUE)
