-- I36-6, I36-7: refusing a qualified person needs the finding, the reasons and the written hearing.
#ASSERT `s 36(c) — the Minister may refuse to authorise the person` (`ind-b person to authorise: standing` `ind-b clean standing` `, may be in conflict` FALSE `, meets the regulations` (JUST TRUE) `, found unfit` TRUE `, reasons given` TRUE `, hearing given` TRUE `, refused` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 36(c) — the Minister may refuse to authorise the person` (`ind-b person to authorise: standing` `ind-b clean standing` `, may be in conflict` FALSE `, meets the regulations` (JUST TRUE) `, found unfit` TRUE `, reasons given` TRUE `, hearing given` FALSE `, refused` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 36(c) — the Minister may refuse to authorise the person` (`ind-b person to authorise: standing` `ind-b clean standing` `, may be in conflict` FALSE `, meets the regulations` (JUST TRUE) `, found unfit` TRUE `, reasons given` FALSE `, hearing given` TRUE `, refused` TRUE)
