-- I36-8: changing the conditions on the modes of action needs a written hearing.
#ASSERT `s 36(d) — the change may be made: it concerns modes of action, and the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` (`Change under section 36(d)` WITH `kind` IS `a condition or instruction as to modes of action`, `the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 36(d) — the change may be made: it concerns modes of action, and the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` (`Change under section 36(d)` WITH `kind` IS `a condition or instruction as to modes of action`, `the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` IS FALSE)
-- I36-8 for a condition on WORK PROCEDURES: my answer (TRUE after a hearing) is the encoder's reading B of
-- fork F-CHANGE; its reading A, which it took, fails in ind-b-tests-ambiguous.l4.
#ASSERT `s 36(d), reading B — the change may be made: it concerns modes of action or work procedures, and the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` (`Change under section 36(d)` WITH `kind` IS `a condition or instruction as to work procedures`, `the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 36(d), reading B — the change may be made: it concerns modes of action or work procedures, and the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` (`Change under section 36(d)` WITH `kind` IS `a condition or instruction as to work procedures`, `the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` IS FALSE)
-- I36-9: an authorisation for 2 years from 1.11.2025 runs to 1.11.2027 inclusive (IL s.10(b); kind V, no s.10(c)).
#ASSERT `s 36(e) — the last day of the authorisation` (`Instrument of authorisation under section 36(e)` WITH `granted on` IS YMD 2025 11 1, `the period fixed in the instrument, if it fixes one` IS JUST (`a number of years fixed in the instrument` 2)) EQUALS YMD 2027 11 1
#ASSERT `s 36(e) — the authorisation runs on the day` (YMD 2027 11 1) `under` (`Instrument of authorisation under section 36(e)` WITH `granted on` IS YMD 2025 11 1, `the period fixed in the instrument, if it fixes one` IS JUST (`a number of years fixed in the instrument` 2))
#ASSERT NOT `s 36(e) — the authorisation runs on the day` (YMD 2027 11 2) `under` (`Instrument of authorisation under section 36(e)` WITH `granted on` IS YMD 2025 11 1, `the period fixed in the instrument, if it fixes one` IS JUST (`a number of years fixed in the instrument` 2))

