#ASSERT `s 39(a) — the last day of a suspension` (`Suspension under section 39(a)` WITH `the suspension began on` IS YMD 2026 1 1, `the period of the suspension` IS `a number of years fixed by the Minister` 5) EQUALS YMD 2031 1 1
#ASSERT `s 39(a) — the authorisation is suspended on the day` (YMD 2031 1 1) `by` (`Suspension under section 39(a)` WITH `the suspension began on` IS YMD 2026 1 1, `the period of the suspension` IS `a number of years fixed by the Minister` 5)
#ASSERT NOT `s 39(a) — the authorisation is suspended on the day` (YMD 2031 1 2) `by` (`Suspension under section 39(a)` WITH `the suspension began on` IS YMD 2026 1 1, `the period of the suspension` IS `a number of years fixed by the Minister` 5)

§§ `s.40 (I40-1, I40-2)`

#ASSERT `s 40 — the party has the status of a State employee for the enactment` `a tester` `the Public Service (Gifts) Law 1979`
#ASSERT `s 40 — the party has the status of a State employee for the enactment` `a tester` `the provisions of the Penal Law about public servants`
#ASSERT `s 40 — the party has the status of a State employee for the enactment` `an expert` `the Public Service (Restrictions after Retirement) Law 1969`
#ASSERT NOT `s 40 — the party has the status of a State employee for the enactment` `a tester` `any other enactment than the three listed`
#ASSERT NOT `s 40 — the party has the status of a State employee for the enactment` `an expert` `any other enactment than the three listed`
